{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29059","headline":"乘月棹舟送大历寺灵聪上人不及 · 许浑","name":"乘月棹舟送大历寺灵聪上人不及","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万峰秋尽百泉清，旧锁禅扉在赤城。\n枫浦客来烟未散，竹窗僧去月犹明。\n杯浮野渡鱼龙远，锡响空山虎豹惊。\n一字不留何足讶，白云无路水无情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}